# 🎓 Which Certifications Do You Actually Need?

## Important answer: **none is mandatory**

You do **not** need 5 OSINT certificates before earning.

I would follow this order:

| Priority | Certification                   | When                  | Recommendation               |
| -------- | ------------------------------- | --------------------- | ---------------------------- |
| 🥇       | **TCM PORP**                    | Month 2–3             | ⭐ Best first practical cert  |
| 🥈       | **Maltego Academy Certificate** | Month 1–2             | Great supplemental           |
| 🥉       | **Trace Labs Badge/CTF**        | Anytime               | Excellent portfolio evidence |
| 🔥       | **IntelTechniques OSIP**        | Later                 | Advanced professional        |
| 🏆       | **GIAC GOSI**                   | Employer-funded/later | Premium                      |

