# 🥇 1. TCM Practical OSINT Research Professional — PORP

For someone following this roadmap, this is probably the **best first serious certification**.

Current PORP exam requires practical OSINT research and a professionally written report rather than multiple-choice questions. Candidates receive **72 hours**, and current exam/training bundle pricing is **$399**, including 9+ hours of training and a free retake. ([TCM Certifications][6])

Topics include:

* Search-engine OSINT
* Image OSINT
* Email
* Breach exposure
* People
* Phone
* Username
* Websites
* Social media
* Automation
* Reporting

[TCM PORP certification details](https://certifications.tcm-sec.com/porp/?utm_source=chatgpt.com)

### My priority:

**★★★★★**

Do this first if budget permits.

