# 💵 Realistic First-Earning Strategy

Don't advertise:

> “I can investigate anyone.”

Advertise:

> **“I provide evidence-backed open-source research and digital-footprint reports using publicly available information.”**

Current examples show why: one recent worldwide Upwork OSINT verification project offered **$50 fixed-price**, while another ongoing digital-identity monitoring project advertised **$10–25/hour**. Those are examples, not guaranteed market rates, but they demonstrate that small research/reporting engagements exist. ([Upwork][1])

A recent higher-level OSINT/analytics engagement advertised **$35–75/hour**, but required extensive experience—showing where the skill can eventually lead rather than where a beginner starts. ([Upwork][12])

